{"seq":2,"slug":"signals-queries","title":"Signal 注入外部事件与 Query 读状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/signals-queries","wordCount":1451,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"signal-注入外部事件与-query-读状态\">Signal 注入外部事件与 Query 读状态</h1><p>前一篇让 Workflow 能等时间，这一篇让它能等<strong>事件</strong>——用户点了审批按钮、支付网关异步回调、上游系统发来对账文件。Temporal 提供三条外部通道，它们的读写语义与历史影响完全不同，混用会带来难查的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>是否写历史</th>\n<th>阻塞调用方</th>\n<th>能否返回值</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Signal</strong></td>\n<td>外部 → Workflow</td>\n<td>是（<code>WorkflowExecutionSignaled</code>）</td>\n<td>否（fire-and-forget，除非用 <code>signalWithStart</code> 等待送达）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>注入事件，最常用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Query</strong></td>\n<td>外部 ← Workflow</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong>（不进历史、不改变状态）</td>\n<td>是（同步返回）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>读当前状态，调试与 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Update</strong></td>\n<td>外部 ↔ Workflow</td>\n<td>是（<code>WorkflowExecutionUpdateAccepted</code> / <code>Completed</code>）</td>\n<td>可选（同步或异步）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>写操作且需要结果确认</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话辨析：<strong>Signal 是单向事件，Query 是只读快照，Update 是带校验与回执的写。</strong> 需要&quot;改状态并马上知道改成功没有&quot;，用 Update；只需要&quot;通知一下&quot;，用 Signal；只需要&quot;看一眼现在怎么样&quot;，用 Query。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  U[用户 / 外部系统] --&gt;|Signal: 审批通过| WF[Workflow Execution]&#10;  U --&gt;|Query: 当前进度?| WF&#10;  WF -.只读, 不进历史.-&gt; Q[Query handler]&#10;  U --&gt;|Update: 改地址| WF&#10;  WF --&gt;|Update 结果| U&#10;  WF --&gt;|Activity| EXT[外部系统]&#10;  EXT --&gt;|Webhook → 你的服务 → Signal| U\">graph LR\n  U[用户 / 外部系统] --&gt;|Signal: 审批通过| WF[Workflow Execution]\n  U --&gt;|Query: 当前进度?| WF\n  WF -.只读, 不进历史.-&gt; Q[Query handler]\n  U --&gt;|Update: 改地址| WF\n  WF --&gt;|Update 结果| U\n  WF --&gt;|Activity| EXT[外部系统]\n  EXT --&gt;|Webhook → 你的服务 → Signal| U</pre><h2 id=\"signal-的投递语义与顺序\">Signal 的投递语义与顺序</h2><p>Signal 的写入是<strong>异步但可靠</strong>的：调用方把 Signal 发给 Server，Server 写入目标 Workflow 的历史并使其可被唤醒。要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>投递是至少一次</strong>。同一条信号可能被重复投递（例如客户端重试），所以 <strong>Signal handler 应设计成幂等</strong>：以业务事件 ID 去重是最简做法。</li>\n<li><strong>顺序按&quot;到达 Server 的顺序&quot;</strong>，不按发送的墙钟顺序。并发来自不同客户端的信号，处理顺序取决于它们写入历史的先后。</li>\n<li><strong>信号进入历史即不可丢</strong>。Workflow 此刻在跑长 Activity，信号会安静地躺在历史里，等下一次 Workflow Task 时被处理——这正是&quot;等 30 天不丢审批&quot;的实现方式。</li>\n<li><strong>发送方无法直接知道&quot;Workflow 收到了&quot;</strong>。想确认送达需要业务层回执：先 <code>signalWithStart</code>，或让 Workflow 在收到后写一条记录供发送方查询（Query 或外部表）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineSignal, setHandler, condition } from &#39;@temporalio/workflow&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const approveSignal = defineSignal&lt;[{ decision: &#39;approve&#39; | &#39;reject&#39;; by: string; eventId: string }]&gt;(&#39;approve&#39;);&#10;&#10;export async function approvalWorkflow(req: ApprovalReq): Promise&lt;Outcome&gt; {&#10;  let decision: &#39;approve&#39; | &#39;reject&#39; | undefined;&#10;  const seen = new Set&lt;string&gt;();&#10;&#10;  setHandler(approveSignal, (payload) =&gt; {&#10;    if (seen.has(payload.eventId)) return; // 幂等去重&#10;    seen.add(payload.eventId);&#10;    decision = payload.decision;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const arrived = await condition(() =&gt; decision !== undefined, &#39;48 hours&#39;);&#10;  return arrived ? { status: decision! } : { status: &#39;timeout&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineSignal, setHandler, condition } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/workflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> approveSignal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;[{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reject'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">by</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">eventId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approvalWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApprovalReq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'reject'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> seen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approveSignal, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">payload</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (seen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload.eventId)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 幂等去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    seen.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload.eventId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload.decision;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> arrived</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arrived </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'timeout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong><code>setHandler</code> 的三个纪律</strong>：handler 里不要做 I/O（用 Activity）；不要写复杂的可变更共享状态（重放会重置）；处理器要能安全地重复执行。handler 内真正的效果应通过设置局部变量、由主流程在 <code>condition</code> 之后统一执行来表达——这样处理逻辑仍然走在确定性主干上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"signalwithstart-消除-启动竞态\">signalWithStart：消除&quot;启动竞态&quot;</h2><p>一个经典竞态：外部系统要先确保 Workflow 存在，再发信号，但如果 Workflow 尚未启动（或上一条已结束），信号就会丢失。<code>signalWithStart</code> 原子地解决它：<strong>若 Workflow 不存在则按给定参数启动，然后投递信号</strong>；若已存在则只投递信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>用 <code>start</code> + <code>signal</code></th>\n<th>用 <code>signalWithStart</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先建流程、稍后由用户操作触发</td>\n<td>可以，但要处理&quot;流程已结束&quot;</td>\n<td>更稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收到 webhook 时流程可能还没建</td>\n<td>有丢信号风险</td>\n<td>正确选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一 Workflow ID 重复收到 webhook</td>\n<td>需自行去重</td>\n<td>幂等（同 ID 复用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>具体例子：支付回调到达时，订单流程可能还在创建中。用 <code>signalWithStart</code> 且以 <code>orderId</code> 作为 Workflow ID，回调既不会丢，也不会创建重复流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"await client.workflow.signalWithStart(paymentWorkflow, {&#10;  workflowId: `order-${orderId}`,&#10;  taskQueue: &#39;orders&#39;,&#10;  signal: paymentCallbackSignal,&#10;  signalArgs: [{ paymentId, status }],&#10;  args: [{ orderId }],&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.workflow.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">signalWithStart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(paymentWorkflow, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workflowId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`order-${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  taskQueue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signal: paymentCallbackSignal,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signalArgs: [{ paymentId, status }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  args: [{ orderId }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"query-只读-不进历史-不能改状态\">Query：只读、不进历史、不能改状态</h2><p>Query 是唯一<strong>不产生任何历史事件</strong>的通道，这让它成为安全的观测手段（见<a href=\"../versioning-ops/visibility-observability\">可见性与排障</a>）。三个特性：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不重放副作用</strong>：Query 只读 Workflow 的当前状态，不执行 Activity。</li>\n<li><strong>不改变执行路径</strong>：因此可以随时调用而不影响确定性。</li>\n<li><strong>要求 Workflow 已在 Worker 上</strong>（或能被重放唤醒）：对休眠中的 Workflow 发起 Query 会触发一次重放以提供服务，因此超长历史的 Query 会较慢。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineQuery, setHandler } from &#39;@temporalio/workflow&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const progressQuery = defineQuery&lt;{ step: string; done: number }&gt;(&#39;progress&#39;);&#10;&#10;setHandler(progressQuery, () =&gt; ({ step: currentStep, done: completed }));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineQuery, setHandler } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/workflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> progressQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">step</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">done</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'progress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(progressQuery, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ step: currentStep, done: completed }));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>值得注意的是：<strong>Query 会把这一状态暴露给你写在 handler 里的任何观察者</strong>（CLI、UI、外部服务）。因此 Query 返回值应当是<strong>已脱敏的业务状态</strong>，不应包含内部凭据、完整用户输入或 PII——这是 <code>[[privacy-by-design]]</code> 在设计新读取面时的要求。如果你需要一个只给运维看的状态，考虑单独开一个运维专用的查询字段，而不是把内部状态全量暴露。</p>\n<h2 id=\"update-带校验与回执的写\">Update：带校验与回执的写</h2><p>Update 在三个通道里最年轻，也是把 Signal 的&quot;写&quot;和 Query 的&quot;读回值&quot;结合的产物。它的语义是：<strong>外部发起一个带 validator 的更新，validator 在 Workflow 上同步执行（拒绝非法输入），通过后被接受，最终返回结果。</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { defineUpdate, setHandler } from &#39;@temporalio/workflow&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const changeAddress = defineUpdate&lt;Address, [Address]&gt;(&#39;changeAddress&#39;);&#10;&#10;setHandler(&#10;  changeAddress,&#10;  async (next: Address): Promise&lt;Address&gt; =&gt; {&#10;    const ok = await validateAddress(next); // Activity&#10;    if (!ok) throw new ApplicationFailure(&#39;invalid address&#39;);&#10;    shippingAddress = next;&#10;    return shippingAddress;&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    validator: (next: Address) =&gt; {&#10;      if (!next.zip) throw new ApplicationFailure(&#39;zip required&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { defineUpdate, setHandler } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/workflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> changeAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'changeAddress'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  changeAddress,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ok</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateAddress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(next); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ok) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApplicationFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'invalid address'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shippingAddress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shippingAddress;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    validator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">next.zip) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApplicationFailure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'zip required'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比项</th>\n<th>Signal</th>\n<th>Update</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（同步或异步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入校验</td>\n<td>需自行在 handler 内做</td>\n<td>validator 在 Acceptance 前执行，非法输入不写历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用方可等待结果</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（<code>waitForStage: &#39;completed&#39;</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>通知型事件</td>\n<td>用户操作、需确认的写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择规则可以直接背下来：<strong>需要回执或需要拒绝非法输入 → Update；否则 Signal。</strong> 一个常见的架构是：用户操作走 Update（可以立刻给用户一个&quot;地址已更新&quot;的确认），系统间的异步回调走 Signal（对方不关心你的处理结果，用幂等 + 对账兜底）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三条通道的语义边界：Signal 单向事件、Query 只读快照不进历史、Update 带校验与回执的写。</li>\n<li>Signal 是至少一次投递，顺序按到达 Server 的次序；handler 必须幂等且不做 I/O。</li>\n<li><code>signalWithStart</code> 消除&quot;流程可能不存在&quot;的竞态，以业务 ID 作 Workflow ID 时可天然幂等。</li>\n<li>Query 不写历史、不改状态，是安全观测手段；但它暴露的字段要按隐私要求脱敏。</li>\n<li>Update 的 validator 在 Acceptance 前执行，非法输入不落历史，需要用户级确认时优先选它。</li>\n<li>组合模式通常是：Update 处理人机交互，Signal 处理机器回调，Query 支撑 UI 与排障。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Signal 注入外部事件与 Query 读状态","id":"signal-注入外部事件与-query-读状态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Signal 的投递语义与顺序","id":"signal-的投递语义与顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"signalWithStart：消除\"启动竞态\"","id":"signalwithstart-消除-启动竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"Query：只读、不进历史、不能改状态","id":"query-只读-不进历史-不能改状态"},{"level":2,"text":"Update：带校验与回执的写","id":"update-带校验与回执的写"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"持久化定时器与长等待","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/durable-timers"},"next":{"title":"子工作流与批量编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/child-workflows"}}